Bench_Alchemy.description = Used to create potions and elixirs.\n\n<i>The alchemists of old long sought the secrets to eternal life. Some might say they achieved that grand goal, though perhaps not in the form they imagined.</i>
Bench_Alchemy.name = Alchemist's Workbench
Bench_Arcane.description = Used to fashion various arcane implements.\n\n<i>The arcane arts are the closest mere mortals have ever come to achieving Avatar powers. Had they mastered them sooner, perhaps they would not have been so easily swayed.</i>
Bench_Arcane.name = Arcanist's Workbench
Bench_Architects.description = Used to create building blocks and furniture. Even an Avatar needs a few comforts!
Bench_Architects.name = Architect's Workbench
Bench_Armory.description = The heart of any workshop. Used to forge advanced armor and weapons.
Bench_Armory.name = Forge
Bench_Armour.description = Used to craft basic armor.
Bench_Armour.name = Armorer's Workbench
Bench_Builders.description = Used to create structural building blocks.
Bench_Builders.name = Builder's Workbench
Bench_Furniture.description = Used to craft furniture, storage, and decorative items to personalize your home.
Bench_Furniture.name = Furniture Workbench
Bench_Campfire.description = Cook basic meals.\n\n<i>To many an adventurer, the humble campfire is all it takes to declare a place "home." Unshakeable bonds can be forged while basking in its warmth and all great tales have sparked from its embers.</i>
Bench_Campfire.name = Campfire
Coop_Chicken.description = Chickens captured in a <item is="Tool_Capture_Crate"/> can be housed here.
