Ingredient_Leather_Heavy.name = Heavy Leather
Ingredient_Leather_Heavy.description = Processed from the thick hides of apex predators.\n\n<i>Every hunter aspires to bring down creatures spoken of only in myth. Save for a few who banded together during the age of heroes, most must be satisfied with bears, wolves, and other apex predators instead.</i>
Ingredient_Leather_Light.name = Light Leather
Ingredient_Leather_Light.description = Processed from the hides of common prey found throughout the wilds.
Ingredient_Leather_Medium.name = Medium Leather
Ingredient_Leather_Medium.description = Processed from the resilient hides of mid-sized threats and armored beasts.
